	measure _CurrentStaff = ```
			
			VAR Currentdate =
			    MAX( 'Dim Date'[Calendar Date] )
			VAR MinDate =
			    MIN( 'Dim Date'[Calendar Date] )
			RETURN
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUMX(
			            'Fact Jobs',
			            IF(
			                'Fact Jobs'[companyStartDate] <= Currentdate
			                    && OR(
			                        'Fact Jobs'[companyEndDate] >= MinDate,
			                        ISBLANK( 'Fact Jobs'[companyEndDate] )
			                    ),
			                1,
			                BLANK()
			            )
			        ),
			        ALLCROSSFILTERED( 'Dim Date' )
			    )
			
			```
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: Demographics
		lineageTag: 85368f9e-b00e-4f69-8755-f83d07f1acbd

